\f0\b \cf2 Whose eyes, and the tone
\f1\b0 \
Still narrator \'97 the crew is the concrete thing the satire hangs on, not a point-of-view with a story of its own (that keeps it a set-up, not a scene). Comic voice, but cut to the bone: one sharp angle \'97 the invasion of the lawn \'97 not a catalogue of snob-jokes. [mine]\

